{"id":184,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"These Pokémon create air-filled bubbles. When Azurill play in rivers, Azumarill will cover them with these bubbles."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It spends most of its time in the water. On sunny days, Azumarill floats on the surface of the water and sunbathes."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Azumarill can make balloons out of air. It makes these air balloons if it spots a drowning Pokémon. The air balloons enable the Pokémon in trouble to breathe."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Azumarill’s long ears are indispensable sensors. By focusing its hearing, this Pokémon can identify what kinds of prey are around, even in rough and fast-running rivers."},{"games":["Y","Crystal"],"text":"The bubble-like pattern on its stomach helps it camouflage itself when it’s in the water."},{"games":["X","Pearl"],"text":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of living things on riverbeds."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of things in water and tell what they are."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It can spend all day in water, since it can inhale and store a large volume of air."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"When it plays in water, it rolls up its elongated ears to prevent their insides from getting wet."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"By keeping still and listening intently, it can tell what is in even wild, fast-moving rivers."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It lives in rivers and lakes. In water, its coloring and patterns trick the vision of foes."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"By keeping still and listening intently, it can even tell what is in wild, fast-moving rivers."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It lives in water virtually all day long. Its body color and pattern act as camouflage that makes it tough for enemies to spot in water."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Thick Fat","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is protected by a layer of thick fat, which halves the damage taken from Fire- and Ice-type moves."},{"name":"Huge Power","hidden":false,"description":"Doubles the Pokémon's Attack stat."},{"name":"Sap Sipper","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon takes no damage when hit by Grass-type moves. Instead, its Attack stat is boosted."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Fairy"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":10,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":298,"name":"Azurill","condition":null,"children":[{"id":183,"name":"Marill","condition":"Level up, High Friendship","children":[{"id":184,"name":"Azumarill","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,39],[1,55],[1,111],[1,205],[1,270],[6,61],[9,204],[12,21],[15,340],[21,401],[25,583],[30,392],[35,240],[40,56],[45,38],[50,276]],"machine":[914,133,59,34,280,523,204,886,91,574,38,577,227,203,263,313,374,411,264,416,447,270,56,63,304,58,8,861,196,282,113,710,118,802,581,341,189,330,583,182,240,156,214,883,164,57,129,36,851,885,352,127,250],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-68","name":"Azumarill","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"68","artist":"Kagemaru Himeno","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-68/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-68/large"},{"id":"sv8-74","name":"Azumarill","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"74","artist":null,"img":"sv8/74"},{"id":"sv7-34","name":"Azumarill","set":"Stellar Crown","date":"2024-09-13","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"34","artist":null,"img":"sv7/34"},{"id":"sv5-65","name":"Azumarill","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Common","number":"65","artist":"Makura Tami","img":"sv5/65"},{"id":"sv2-45","name":"Azumarill","set":"Paldea Evolved","date":"2023-06-09","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"45","artist":"E